# The private/public gate for a public repository. Verify by effect, never by reading this
# file: AGENTS.md, "Security", carries the probe and what each of its flags is for.
#
# Patterns are unanchored on purpose: one too broad costs a false exclusion, one too narrow
# leaks a credential. After any change here this must print nothing, because no tracked file
# may match an ignore pattern:
#   git ls-files | git -c core.excludesFile=/dev/null check-ignore --no-index --stdin
#
# This file cannot see a key inside a URL. AGENTS.md, "Endpoint URLs", is the gate for that.
#
# No build or dependency output is listed, because this repository has no stack. Add the
# ecosystem's own output directories in the change that adds a stack.

# Secrets & credentials
.env
.env.*
# Negation is the example CLASS, not one filename: `.env.local.example` is a template
# and must reach a clone. End-anchored, so `.env.example.local` stays ignored. Do not narrow.
!.env*.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
credentials.json
service-account.json
secrets/

# Package-registry auth — these carry registry tokens (`_authToken`,
# `npmAuthIdent`). An .npmrc can also weaken install-time supply-chain settings,
# and ignoring it hides that line from review — so a repo may deliberately track
# a credential-free, policy-only .npmrc instead. Decide; do not inherit.
# Release-age settings do not belong in this file either way: they go in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml, which is committed and is not ignored here.
.npmrc
.yarnrc
.yarnrc.yml

# Claude Code — this directory is TRACKED so repo-local agents, skills and rules
# travel with the repo. Only machine-local and agent-written state is held back.
# Do not invert this into a blanket ignore: an agent inside an ignored directory
# never reaches a clone.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/agent-memory-local/
.claude/launch.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/**/*.local.*
.claude/**/*-local/

# Internal development directory — sits at repo root alongside .github/ and .claude/
# Contains session notes, design briefs, dev logs, planning docs. Never commit.
.local/

# Ad-hoc planning docs at root (use .local/ instead going forward)
SESSION_NOTES.md
PLANNING.md
SCRATCH.md
*.scratch.*
*.draft.*

# Blockchain & crypto
keystore/
*.keystore
wallet.json
mnemonic.txt
# A node's private identity key. The client writes it as <datadir>/geth/nodekey, a name
# *.key does not match.
nodekey

# IDE & OS
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
